@startuml RF45_Sequencia
title RF45 — Processar e padronizar imagens canônicas de peças, calçados e acessórios (pipeline de validação e padronização)\nDiagrama de sequência — endpoints reais e motores de visão (fai-application · vision)
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #4A4852
  LifeLineBorderColor #CBC6BE
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #F4F2EF
  ParticipantBorderColor #4A4852
}
autonumber
actor "Pessoa" as U
participant "Frontend\npieces/new" as FE
participant "WardrobeController" as C
participant "CaptureSessionService\n<<planejado>>" as CS #FAFAFA
participant "WardrobeService" as W
participant "AiEngine (RF24)" as AI
participant "LandmarkDetector\nBrandEnsembleResolver\nIdentificationHierarchy" as V
participant "PhotographyQualityGate" as Q
participant "AdaptiveCaptureEngine" as A
participant "CanonicalPhotographer\n+ PhotographySpecs" as CP
participant "MediaStoragePort\n(S3 / local)" as ST
database "MySQL" as DB

note over U, FE
  O criador de peça (pieces/new) não envia mais foto:
  POST /api/pieces/analysis segue no backend, sem tela que o chame nesse fluxo
end note
U -> FE: escolhe o tipo e envia a foto principal
alt fluxo implementado hoje
  FE -> C: POST /api/pieces/analysis (file, category)
  C -> W: analyze(user, bytes, category)
else fluxo de captura adaptativa
  FE -> CS: POST /api/capture/sessions (file, category, viewType, identifyModel)
  note right of CS: <<planejado>> não há controller /api/capture/**\nnão implementado — conforme Trello
  CS -> ST: put(piece_original_{vista}.jpg) — ORIGINAL imutável
  CS -> W: analyzeForCapture(user, bytes, category, lenient=true)
end
W -> AI: FLAT_LAY_STANDARDIZER (rembg → remove.bg → local)
AI --> W: recorte + studioSource
W -> AI: CONTENT_MODERATOR / PIECE_ANALYZER
AI --> W: PieceGuess (categoria, subcategoria, marca, confianças)
W --> CS: CaptureAnalysis (draft, studioSource, logoBox, ocr, failedChecks)
CS -> V: detect(cutout, family) · resolve(evidências) · reconcile()
V --> CS: landmarks + BrandPrediction por IdentificationLevel
CS -> Q: evaluate(profile, view, Signals)
Q --> CS: Report(score, ACCEPT | ACCEPT_WITH_GUIDANCE | RETAKE_SUGGESTED)
CS -> A: decide(Context)
A --> CS: Decision(next, alternatives, done, doneReason)
opt Decision.done = false
  CS -> DB: INSERT capture_requests (PENDING, expected_gain, confidence_before)
  CS --> FE: 201 sessão AWAITING_CAPTURE + próxima vista
  alt pessoa envia a vista complementar
    FE -> CS: POST /api/capture/sessions/{id}/images <<planejado>>
    CS -> DB: UPDATE capture_requests FULFILLED (confidence_after)
  else pessoa pula
    FE -> CS: POST /api/capture/sessions/{id}/requests/{requestId}/skip <<planejado>>
    CS -> DB: UPDATE capture_requests SKIPPED
  end
end
CS -> CP: render(cutout, PhotographySpecs.get(specId), landmarks, clipped)
CP --> CS: Result(image, Report: specId, rotação, escala, cobertura)
CS -> ST: put(piece_product_front.png, piece_logo_detail.png…)
CS -> DB: INSERT piece_images (CANONICAL/DETAIL, derived_from_id), brand_predictions,\ngarment_landmarks, model_inferences
CS --> FE: sessão READY_FOR_REVIEW (identificação, qualidade, canônicos)
U -> FE: confirma
FE -> C: POST /api/pieces (PieceForm.captureSessionId)
C -> W: create(user, form)
W -> DB: INSERT wardrobe_items (capture_session_id, canonical_image_url)
C --> FE: 201 PieceView
@enduml
